<rdfs:comment>An interval of time over which the toleranceTarget is acceptable before indication of an objective violation.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_toleranceTarget -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_toleranceTarget">
<InformationModel_v1:hasOrigin>ServiceLevelObjective</InformationModel_v1:hasOrigin>
<InformationModel_v1:hasStereotype></InformationModel_v1:hasStereotype>
<rdf:label>toleranceTarget</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A value that specifies the allowable variation of a conformanceTarget.</rdfs:comment>
